"""#####

    /// POI icon sections for the OSM Liberty Topo style: OSM Liberty's Maki markers,
    /// and its ring around a Maki, Temaki or carto glyph (all CC0) where it has none,
    /// rendered to 16 px TYP bitmaps, disc and glyph turned over at night.
    /// See Assets/styles/liberty-topo/points.txt.
    static let libertyTopoPoints =
#####"""
; POI icons for the OSM Liberty Topo shipped style, written by a maintainer's tool. The
; style draws a point as the marker of the OpenMapTiles class its OSM tag falls in, from
; the sprite of OSM Liberty; each code takes the marker of the class its meaning (named
; in Assets/styles/type-names.txt) falls in, from OSM Liberty's current icon set
; (maputnik/osm-liberty svgs/svgs_iconset, commit da161553f7d2; Maki glyphs, CC0), which
; also has markers for meanings the 2020 set lacked (109). Where it still has
; none, the style's ring holds a Maki, Temaki or openstreetmap-carto glyph (CC0), and the
; rock is topoactive's own (9). A code topoactive marks with its plain label
; anchor gets that square (topoactive 0x661a), day and night, with its label (15).
; Rendered at 16 px with rsvg-convert and read back 3 ways: a pixel under alpha 112 is
; clear; of the rest, R+G+B under 600 is ink #333333, the rest white. Night turns the
; marker over: a light glyph on a dark disc. Every point code kmap's rules emit has a
; section but the settlement points 0x0100-0x0d00, which the device draws, and kmap's
; repair mark 0x660b, which the build adds. Names are added from type-names.txt.

