"""#####

    /// POI icon sections for the carto and CyclOSM styles: openstreetmap-carto's
    /// symbols, else Maki or Temaki (all CC0), drawn at 20 px with a soft edge,
    /// appended verbatim to the generated TYP.
    /// See Assets/styles/osm-carto/points.txt for how they were made.
    static let cartoPoints =
#####"""
; POI icons for the osm-carto shipped style; CyclOSM ships the same file. Written by a
; maintainer's tool. Every icon is drawn from a vector at 20 pixels on its longer side,
; with a soft edge: a pixel partly covered is its colour blended over the land. Carto's own
; symbol (openstreetmap-carto symbols/**, CC0, commit 1cc4b89c48e4385b607d63156d6f8f1eea8b35a2)
; in the marker-fill carto gives it in style/amenity-points.mss (95); for a meaning
; carto draws no symbol for, a Maki or Temaki icon (CC0) in the carto ink of its category
; (20). A code topoactive marks with its plain label anchor gets that anchor square
